WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:04.092
Unit four. Preventive Healthcare for Adulthood!

2
00:00:05.016 --> 00:00:09.705
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.755 --> 00:00:12.774
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.825 --> 00:00:17.922
Today we learn about Preventive Healthcare for Adulthood. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.892 --> 00:00:23.825
Preventive healthcare. Say it with me. Preventive healthcare!

6
00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:31.789
Annual checkup. Say it with me. Annual checkup!

7
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:39.757
Screening test. Say it with me. Screening test!

8
00:00:43.258 --> 00:00:48.358
Immunization schedule. Say it with me. Immunization schedule!

9
00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:56.667
Risk assessment. Say it with me. Risk assessment!

10
00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:03.956
Health record. Say it with me. Health record!

11
00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:12.049
Early detection. Say it with me. Early detection!

12
00:01:15.522 --> 00:01:19.989
Wellness visit. Say it with me. Wellness visit!

13
00:01:23.489 --> 00:01:41.700
Preventive healthcare includes scheduling an annual checkup and a regular screening test. Following an immunization schedule and completing a risk assessment support early detection of problems. Keeping a health record helps track each wellness visit.

14
00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:45.250
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:45.943 --> 00:01:51.267
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:51.317 --> 00:01:52.788
Screening test!

17
00:01:53.957 --> 00:01:59.290
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.873
Early detection!

19
00:02:01.915 --> 00:02:11.016
Did you know? Many diseases, including several types of cancer, have much higher survival rates when caught early through regular screening.

20
00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:13.328
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.483 --> 00:02:23.723
Think and answer. Why is early detection often better than treating a problem later?

22
00:02:23.773 --> 00:02:24.923
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:31.622
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:31.672 --> 00:02:34.566
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

